    "group": "Attack Bike Squad",
    "summary": "Once per turn, in the Shooting phase of your opponent's turn, when an enemy unit picks as a target a friendly **ADEPTUS ASTARTES MOUNTED** unit that this unit is within 6\" of, this Attack Bike Squad can respond:\n\n- once that enemy unit has made all its attacks, this unit shoots, as it would in your Shooting phase\n- that enemy unit is the only unit those attacks can target, and it must be an eligible target",
